--- !u!1001 &825583382
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 368257032}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 4284831735717970974, guid: fca19c64cb0e5784982200005fb6f793, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageText
      value: "I ventured into this accursed place, to see if the legends about Maerimond
        were true. I found more than I bargained for. \n\nI leave this note beside
        a poor skellie \u2014likely a bandit from an age long past\u2014 as a warning
        to you:\n\nThe stone knights here are formidable. Steel won't scratch them
        - only blunt weapons like axes stand a chance.\n\nAnd beware the light pillars
        scattered throughout. Each one lit strengthens these accursed guardians.
        Embrace the darkness if you value your life.\n\nIf you're foolish enough
        to press on, may fortune favor your bravery. As for me, I've had enough.
        I'm getting out while I still can."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4791771858032374034, guid: fca19c64cb0e5784982200005fb6f793, type: 3}
      propertyPath: title
      value: Just a note...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
